$10 margin x 3x = approximately $30 position

LEVERAGE=3

Isolated margin

TD_MODE=isolated

INITIAL SL / TP

SL_PERCENT=0.50
TP_PERCENT=0.80

STEP PROFIT PROTECTION

When profit reaches 0.50%, move protection forward

STEP_TRIGGER_PCT=0.50

